OL,3,GNEWSAShania Twain to headline Essex
OL,4,Afestival next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FCountry pop music icon Shania Twain has
OL,7,Fbeen revealed as the first headliner
OL,8,Ffor next year's second edition of an
OL,9,FAmericana music festival in Essex.
OL,11,FThe five-time Grammy-award winner will
OL,12,Fperform at State Fayre in Hylands Park,
OL,13,FChelmsford, on Saturday, 19 June.
OL,15,FThe singer, whose hits include Man, I
OL,16,FFeel Like A Woman and That Don't
OL,17,FImpress Me Much, said she had heard the
OL,18,Fevent, which was held for the first
OL,19,Ftime this summer, was "a blast",
OL,20,Fadding: "I can't wait to experience it
OL,21,Ffor myself."
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
