OL,3,GNEWSAShania Twain to headline Essex
OL,4,Afestival next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers described Twain as "an icon
OL,7,Fnot just in the history of country
OL,8,Fmusic, but also in global culture
OL,9,Fitself" and said she would be "the
OL,10,Fperfect fit for what State Fayre is all
OL,11,Fabout".
